[00:35.18]1. Come share in the work of our Master;
[00:41.68]Respond to his call and obey.
[00:47.06]He offers to help and to guide you;
[00:51.82]His teaching will show you the way.
[00:57.68]The seed of the truth has power to grow
[01:03.36]In hearts that are honest and true.
[01:09.06]So give of your best as you faithfully share
[01:15.48]In the work you’ve been given to do.
[01:29.98]2. How much of your work is successful
[01:35.72]May often depend much on you.
[01:41.74]Those hearing will need your assistance
[01:46.62]To learn and to love what is true.
[01:52.86]So help them to deal with pressures and doubts
[01:58.44]They’re certain to face on their way.
[02:03.96]The seed of the truth will bring joy when you see
[02:10.06]How it grows in their heart day by day.
